    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_01_072",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_eventstory_8_01",
      "speaker": "chieri",
      "text": "なるほど、ちえりたちがサクッと優勝して 賞金をいただいちゃうって計算ですね！",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_eventstory_8_01/adv_voice_eventstory_8_01_072.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_01/adv_script_eventstory_8_01-Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_01-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "56f107ef3905b4f833e89282d0d852d35a61ce9eea1f641954d752fdf5b336e9",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_eventstory_8_01_072.wav",
      "subtitle": "原来如此，计划的就是我们轻松夺冠\n然后把奖金拿到手吧！",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "28ec8f5ca0d2976fe23e801a078b66bc1fc0d48a4b1d94dace71722009808116",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_eventstory_8_01/adv_script_eventstory_8_01-Text/adv_script_eventstory_8_01-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_106",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02",
      "speaker": "chieri",
      "text": "あーもうっ！！ 身長ばっかりデカくて邪魔です！ ちえりの行く道を阻まないでください！",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_106.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "baf22d8e8649745c3be65e56680fd7cd19edcd169269b4e8aa3d4a22dbc871b3",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_106.wav",
      "subtitle": "啊——真是的！！光长个子真碍事！\n不许挡千樱梨的路！",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "e8b78f27db9fdcfba84fadf0b40584356714f70fd69ef470bec18501b6d0b0ea",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_110",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02",
      "speaker": "chieri",
      "text": "じゃあここでじめじめ弾いててください！ ちえりがステージの照明独り占めするんで！",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_110.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "a9be99ce62ddf3118f746852c1c8eaf60efa67ddcf543a40984d6af1579d8142",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_110.wav",
      "subtitle": "那你就在这儿阴暗地弹吧！\n舞台灯光千樱梨要一个人独占！",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "870bd46fde7eb446b96d4c9edfbec24b5e59fa0b1054a68cdbd106f22153dd0c",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_114",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02",
      "speaker": "chieri",
      "text": "ふふん、凄まじいオーラに声も出ないんですか。 まあそういうこともあります。気圧されるってやつです",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_114.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "c100a9b1588b42171ce82651befe60f2a748e6117786fd7b9df4d3a774954c6c",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_114.wav",
      "subtitle": "哼哼，是被千樱梨这惊人的气势吓得说不出话了吧。\n这也是常有的事。就是所谓的被震慑住了",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "80344f7a1f4e3342007ceb8cff122b38c91a4e5ec7abf14e6a359755f99e19ce",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Text.json.br"
    },
